  node [
    id 39
    label "LnjY4NTWxTc"
    step 0
    date "2022-02-12T22:03:47Z"
    title "NYC municipal workers protest vaccine mandate"
    description "(7 Feb 2022) FOR CLEAN VERSION SEE STORY NUMBER: 4364921&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;Over a hundred people marched over the Brooklyn Bridge on Monday to protest New York's municipal worker vaccination mandate.&#13;&#10;The city's municipal workforce are required to be vaccinated by Friday or face termination.&#13;&#10;The rally was not all unvaccinated workers, some vaccinated New Yorkers showed up to support the protestors.&#13;&#10;John Mooney, a vaccinated municipal employee, stood before the crowd and ripped his vaccination card in half.&#13;&#10;&#34;I'm fully vaccinated, I'm boosting, I even had cancer three years ago, chemotherapy, surgery, everything. I'm fully vaccinated, but I don't want to be segregated from the unvaccinated. There should be no mandates. Workers should not be fired. Union members have to stick together. Unity, not separation. That's why I came here today with my vaccination card, I held it up and I ripped it up,&#34; said Mooney.&#13;&#10;While the mandate was first proposed by former Bill de Blasio, new mayor Eric Adams has continued to support the mandate.&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;Find out more about AP Archive: http://www.aparchive.com/HowWeWork &#13;&#10;Twitter: https://twitter.com/AP_Archive &#13;&#10;Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/APArchives &#8203;&#8203;&#13;&#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/APNews/&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;You can license this story through AP Archive: http://www.aparchive.com/metadata/youtube/4452fe6be0184faa80d1bf4bc7b1f209"
    channeltitle "AP Archive"
