  node [
    id 55
    label "RjuA4okawaM"
    step 0
    date "2021-10-09T13:00:24Z"
    title "Can Republicans Stop Bidens Vaccine Mandate?"
    description "The Biden administration seems sure its vaccine mandates are legal. Republican governors are sure that they're illegal, and vowing to fight Biden to the gates of hell. So who's right? Michael Kalenderian spoke with a law professor to find out what the hell's going on.&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;Subscribe to VICE News here: http://bit.ly/Subscribe-to-VICE-News&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;Check out VICE News for more: http://vicenews.com&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;Follow VICE News here:&#13;&#10;Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/vicenews&#13;&#10;Twitter: https://twitter.com/vicenews&#13;&#10;Tumblr: http://vicenews.tumblr.com/&#13;&#10;Instagram: http://instagram.com/vicenews&#13;&#10;More videos from the VICE network: https://www.fb.com/vicevideo&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;#VICENews #News"
    channeltitle "VICE News"
