    date "2022-01-20T02:07:37Z"
    title "Biden decries court ruling on vaccine mandate"
    description "President Joe Biden acknowledged Wednesday that the pandemic has left Americans exhausted and demoralized but insisted at a news conference marking his first year in office that he has &#8220;outperformed&#8221; expectations.  (Jan. 19)&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;Subscribe for more Breaking News: http://smarturl.it/AssociatedPress &#13;&#10;Website: https://apnews.com &#13;&#10;Twitter: https://twitter.com/AP &#13;&#10;Facebook: https://facebook.com/APNews &#13;&#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/APNews/&#13;&#10;&#8203;&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;You can license this story through AP Archive: http://www.aparchive.com/metadata/youtube/ce1e62abcdf14704b40a16a320642313"
