    label "VGD4vyogJsE"
    step 0
    date "2021-11-04T21:11:46Z"
    title "Federal COVID-19 vaccine mandate to start January 4th, 2022"
    description "(AP) Tens of millions of Americans who work at companies with 100 or more employees will need to be vaccinated against COVID-19 by Jan. 4 or get tested for the virus weekly under government rules that took effect Thursday.&#10;&#10;The new requirements are the Biden administration&#8217;s boldest move yet to persuade reluctant Americans to finally get a vaccine that has been widely available for months -- or potentially face financial consequences. &#10;&#10;If successful, administration officials believe it will go a long way toward ending a pandemic that has killed more than 750,000 Americans.&#10;&#10;First previewed by President Joe Biden in September, the requirements will apply to about 84 million workers at medium and large businesses, although it is not clear how many of those employees are unvaccinated.&#10;&#10;READ MORE: https://www.wkyc.com/article/news/health/coronavirus/vaccine/us-finalizes-vaccine-mandate-companies-100-employees/507-5aeac651-04e1-487c-95ef-b3f28d10dbb4"
