    label "MORoYLtyepM"
    step 0
    date "2022-01-31T20:36:37Z"
    title "COVID-19: Why did some NHS staff refuse the jab?"
    description "The Health Secretary Sajid Javid has backed down on compulsory jabs for NHS workers, saying the requirement is 'no longer proportionate'.&#10;&#10;The government is dropping the rules, which would have meant staff in England had until this week to receive their first jab, or face losing their jobs in April.&#10;&#10;Some NHS staff say that the mandate U-turn comes too late, as many who didn't want to get the vaccine have already left their positions. &#10;&#10;Sky's Ashish Joshi speaks to one medical student who did not want the coronavirus vaccine.&#10;&#10;Read more here:&#10;https://news.sky.com/story/covid-19-health-secretary-announces-review-into-mandatory-jabs-for-nhs-staff-12529546&#10;&#10;SUBSCRIBE to our YouTube channel for more videos: http://www.youtube.com/skynews &#10;&#10;Follow us on Twitter: https://twitter.com/skynews &#10;&#10;Like us on Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/skynews &#10;&#10;Follow us on Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/skynews &#10;&#10;For more content go to http://news.sky.com and download our apps: Apple: https://itunes.apple.com/gb/app/sky-news/id316391924?mt=8 Android https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.bskyb.skynews.android&#38;hl=en_GB&#10;&#10;Sky News videos are now available in Spanish here / Los video de Sky News est&#225;n disponibles en espa&#241;ol aqu&#237; https://www.youtube.com/channel/skynewsespanol&#10;&#10;To enquire about licensing Sky News content, contact clipsales@sky.uk"
