    description "Medical secretary, Mirren Brewer, doesn&#8217;t call herself an antivaxer, yet such is her and her husband&#8217;s fear of the potential side effects of the vaccine &#8212; they both work for the same NHS trust &#8212; that they would prefer to lose their jobs than get jabbed.&#10;&#10;Read more on this story: https://www.thetimes.co.uk/article/unvaccinated-health-staff-band-together-as-73-000-face-sack-xk9fnphvf&#10;Read the best of our journalism: https://www.thetimes.co.uk/&#13;&#10;Subscribe to The Times and The Sunday Times YouTube channel: https://www.youtube.com/subscription_center?add_user=timesonlinevideo&#13;&#10;Find us on Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/timesandsundaytimes/&#13;&#10;Follow The Times on Twitter: https://twitter.com/thetimes&#13;&#10;Follow The Sunday Times on Twitter: https://twitter.com/thesundaytimes&#13;&#10;Find best pictures and news videos from The Times on Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/thetimes/"
