    title "Protesters against vaccine mandate in Belgium clash with police"
    description "A protest in Brussels turned violent as thousands demonstrated to denounce measures aimed at halting the spread of COVID-19.&#13;&#10;Belgian police sprayed water cannons and fired tear gas on demonstrators, with some in the crowd throwing fireworks and beer cans.&#13;&#10;About 8,000 people tried to reach the European Union headquarters in the Belgian capital but were blocked.&#13;&#10;Al Jazeera's @Nadim Baba reports.&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;- Subscribe to our channel: http://aje.io/AJSubscribe &#13;&#10;- Follow us on Twitter: https://twitter.com/AJEnglish &#13;&#10;- Find us on Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/aljazeera &#13;&#10;- Check our website: https://www.aljazeera.com/&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;#AlJazeeraEnglish #Belgium #COVID19"
