  node [
    id 300
    label "UhB73F6CBOI"
    step 0
    date "2021-09-02T00:02:02Z"
    title "Doctor speaks out against hospital vaccine mandate"
    description "Original airdate: 8/31/2021 | A Lehigh Valley doctor is speaking out after the region's three largest health providers jointly announced a COVID-19 vaccine mandate for its employees and contractors.&#10;&#10;Dr. Chaminie Wheeler said she is not against vaccines--she's had the flu shot and others. She said she also advocates for her patients to get various vaccinations.&#10;&#10;But she did not get vaccinated against COVID-19 and -- even as a health care worker--doesn't think she should have to.&#10;&#10;View the full story at WFMZ.com:&#10;https://www.wfmz.com/news/area/pennsylvania/local-doctor-speaks-out-against-hospital-vaccine-mandate-we-have-to-give-individuals-freedom-to/article_1b84ffcc-0aa0-11ec-844b-6f5c0669dd1c.html"
