    title "COVID-19: Reaction pours in after Quebec scraps vaccine mandate for health-care workers"
    description "Reaction continues to pour in after Quebec&#8217;s government announced it would scrap a COVID-19 vaccine mandate for health-care workers, citing a potential impact in the ability to care for patients.&#10;&#10;Before Wednesday, Quebec was on track to require inoculation by Nov. 15, but said the loss of unvaccinated staff would have had a &#8220;devastating effect on the system.&#8221;&#10;&#10;As Gloria Henriquez reports, advocates have been swift to condemn the government for its decision not to require vaccination in the health sector.&#10;&#10;For more info, please go to https://globalnews.ca/news/8350209/ontario-quebec-covid-vaccine-mandate-hospitals/&#10;Subscribe to Global News Channel HERE: http://bit.ly/20fcXDc&#10;Like Global News on Facebook HERE: http://bit.ly/255GMJQ&#10;Follow Global News on Twitter HERE: http://bit.ly/1Toz8mt&#10;Follow Global News on Instagram HERE: https://bit.ly/2QZaZIB&#10;#Coronavirus #COVID19 #GlobalNews"
