    title "Covid-19-UK: Scrapping vaccine mandates for NHS staff  says Thornberry"
    description "#UKNews #UKCovid #UKpolitics #covid #covid19 #covidvaccine #NHS #NHSstaff #vaccinemandate&#10;&#10;Covid-19-UK: Shadow Attorney General Emily Thornberry says that the Government should review the policy on mandatory Covid vaccinations for NHS and social care workers. She also says the planned rise in National Insurance should be reviewed.&#10;&#10;Health Secretary Sajid Javid (left) is expected to scrap the controversial mandatory vaccinations for NHS and social care works amid warnings of crippling staff shortages if the plan went ahead (right: demonstrators protest against mandatory jabs for NHS staff). Mr Javid is on Monday expected to meet ministers on the Covid-Operations Cabinet committee to finalise the U-Turn, reported the Telegraph.&#10;&#10;Original Article: http://www.dailymail.co.uk/news/article-10458231/Sajid-Javid-SCRAPS-plans-make-Covid-jabs-mandatory-NHS-staff.html&#10;Original Video: http://www.dailymail.co.uk/video/newsalerts/video-2601759/Video-Thornberry-Worth-thinking-mandatory-Covid-jabs-NHS-again.html&#10;&#10;Daily Mail Facebook: http://facebook.com/dailymail&#10;Daily Mail IG: http://instagram.com/dailymail&#10;Daily Mail Snap: https://www.snapchat.com/discover/Daily-Mail/8392137033&#10;Daily Mail Twitter: http://twitter.com/MailOnline&#10;Daily Mail Pinterest: http://pinterest.co.uk/dailymail&#10;Daily Mail Google+: https://plus.google.com/+DailyMail&#10;&#10;Get the free Daily Mail mobile app: http://dailymail.co.uk/mobile"
