    title "COVID-19: British Columbias capital braces for anti-vaccine, anti-mandate protest convoy"
    description "Despite COVID-19 restrictions lifting across Canada, another convoy pushing back against public health restrictions and vaccine mandates is expected to occupy Victoria. &#10;&#10;British Columbia is already dropping mask mandates, with plans to lift most other COVID restrictions on April 8. But organizers of the planned gathering at the B.C. Legislature tell Global News they will be in it for the long haul.&#10;&#10;Lauren Pullen explains why those organizers insist on going through with the protest.&#10;&#10;For more info, please go to https://globalnews.ca/news/8676173/victoria-bc-freedom-convoy-covid-mandate-protest-monday/&#10;Subscribe to Global News Channel HERE: http://bit.ly/20fcXDc&#10;Like Global News on Facebook HERE: http://bit.ly/255GMJQ&#10;Follow Global News on Twitter HERE: http://bit.ly/1Toz8mt&#10;Follow Global News on Instagram HERE: https://bit.ly/2QZaZIB&#10;#COVID19 #Coronavirus #GlobalNews"
