    title "Vaccines in the Workplace - Employment Lawyer Explains Vaccine Mandate, Biden Executive Orders"
    description "This video demystifies and clearly explains the latest vaccine mandate and Biden Administration's executive orders. Our expert employment lawyer and partner, Marie Davis, Esq, explains the frequently asked questions on the topic of &#34;Vaccines in the Workplace&#34; and all sort of executive orders and upcoming regulations on vaccine mandates, vaccine verification, and your options. Please like this video if you find the information helpful, and subscribe to our channel to stay informed. &#10; &#10;- Get your digital vaccines at: https://myvaccinerecord.cdph.ca.gov/&#10;- The LA County Public Health website news release:  http://publichealth.lacounty.gov/phcommon/public/media/mediapubhpdetail.cfm?prid=3383&#10;- City of LA vaccination ordinance at: https://clkrep.lacity.org/onlinedocs/2021/21-0878_ord_draft_9-24-21.pdf&#10;&#10;Landegger Verano &#38; Davis, ALC is a California employment law firm exclusively representing employers and business owners. Our employment lawyers specialize in employment &#38; labor laws. We have extensive experience in defending employers and assisting our clients in avoiding costly litigation. &#10;&#10;Committed to making the workplace better, we have comprehensive resources to train and educate employers on employee classification, wage-and-hour issues, sexual harassment prevention, discrimination prevention, drafting comprehensive and legally compliant employee handbooks, and more. Check out our informative training and educational videos on some of the latest development in employment laws for business owners, managers, and human resources professionals to avoid employee lawsuits. &#10;&#10;Headquarter based in Encino, Landegger Verano &#38; Davis, ALC has two satellite offices in Pasadena and Camarillo, providing employment law services to employers and business owners throughout the greater Los Angeles areas, San Fernando Valley, and Ventura Counties, as well as throughout all of Southern California.&#10;&#10;Contact us at (818) 986-7561 or visit our website at www.landeggeresq.com for more information.&#10;&#10;#vaccinemandate #workplacehealth #vaccine #HR #employers &#10;#workplace #employmentlaw #ReligiousExemption #LACounty &#10;#EmploymentLawyer #LaborAttorney #LaborLawAttorney &#10;#LaborLawyer #CaliforniaEmploymentLawyers &#10;#healthcareworkers #largeemployers #Lawyers #EmploymentLaws #LaborLaws #HumanResources #Wageandhour #SexualHarassmentPrevention #Harassment #Discrimination #EmployeeHandbook #EmployeeClassification&#10;&#10;Disclaimer: &#10;The information on this YouTube Channel is not intended or implied to be a substitute for professional advice.  All content including text, graphics, images and information contained on or available through this channel is for general information purposes only.&#10;&#10;This channel makes no representation and assumes no responsibility for the accuracy of the information on or available through this channel, and such information is subject to change without notice."
