    sentiment 0.128
    leftright ""
    channeltags ""
  ]
  node [
    id 417
    label "I3-Th8OsWZA"
    step 0
    date "2022-07-16T20:20:52Z"
    title "Future Travel Rules - Testing Requirements, Vaccine Mandates, Prices"
    description "Future Travel Rules - Testing Requirements, Vaccine Mandates, Prices. People keep asking us whether in our Facebook Group or in the comments of our YouTube videos about the future of travel. Will Carnival Cruise Lines lift it's testing requirements? When will vaccine mandates end? Are prices going up or down? Is the border going to close again? When it comes to questions like these no one can know the future so anyone who tells you they know what's coming treat as a fun speculation or theory but only the official sources should be trust about the current state of travel and travel rules. Check the CDC, cruise line, hotel, or other website before committing to travel.&#10;&#10;YouTubers can give you a lot of great advice, but they don't know the future. Travel restrictions can be frustrating, change frequently, and vary from place to place - it's hard enough to keep track of it all without adding amateur fortune tellers into the mix&#10;&#10;Check out our Facebook Group: http://facebook.com/groups/CarnivalVIFPClub&#10;&#10;Subscribe for more videos&#10;https://www.youtube.com/vacationimpossible?sub_confirmation=1&#10;&#10;Check out our podcast&#10;http://vacationimpossible.podbean.com&#10;&#10;Filmed on a Moto G Power https://amzn.to/31Bp5rY&#10;As an Amazon Associate I earn from qualifying purchases.&#10;&#10;SEO Optimized with TubeBuddy https://www.tubebuddy.com/vacation&#10;&#10;Join our Patreon&#10;https://www.patreon.com/VacationImpossible&#10;&#10;#TestingRequirements #Price #TravelRestrictions"
    channeltitle "Vacation Impossible"
    channelid "UCiT6xTU1ZcTaWTaRXcrgZMg"
    favcount 0
    viewcount 40
    likecount 0
    commentcount 0
    duration "PT1M"
    indegree 0
